250
01:25:23.610 --> 01:25:26.610
Not your wife, not your husband, not your pastor.

251
01:25:27.610 --> 01:25:28.610
It is not up to me.

252
01:25:28.610 --> 01:25:30.610
As long as I do what I must do.

253
01:25:31.610 --> 01:25:36.610
