01:27:04.610 --> 01:27:05.610
I hope it is not the case that coming together makes you enthusiastic for Jesus.

271
01:27:05.610 --> 01:27:06.610
I hope it is not the case that coming together makes you enthusiastic for Jesus.

272
01:27:06.610 --> 01:27:08.610
For when you walk away from here, you have nothing left.

273
01:27:08.610 --> 01:27:11.610
For when you walk away from here, you have nothing left.

274
01:27:11.610 --> 01:27:14.610
You say that it is all the push and the drum.

