01:27:18.610 --> 01:27:21.610
But it is the revelation of the Lamb.

278
01:27:21.610 --> 01:27:24.610
It is the revelation of the Word consumption.

279
01:27:25.610 --> 01:27:27.610
We are filled messengers.

